      "text": "After a prolonged examination of the relationship, the relationship enforcer has spurned attempts at reconciliation from the tech entity. The regulatory body is now imposing a steep cost for broken trust, with a financial penalty expected to reach the high hundreds of millions of euros. This formal decision, anticipated before the Commission's August recess, adds to a history of strained relations, following years where the dominant partner ranked its own services above the overlooked rivals in search results.",
